{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 6742627898760661314,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Major Changes",
      "source_hash": 14901818022379486383,
      "context_hash": 6056107742514218378,
      "translation": "주요 변경사항",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:51.275624Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Triagebot helps with automated processing of [Major Change Proposals](../compiler/proposals-and-stabilization.md#how-do-i-submit-an-mcp).",
      "source_hash": 2871629385625595073,
      "context_hash": 869063200259592069,
      "translation": "Triagebot는 [주요 변경 제안](../compiler/proposals-and-stabilization.md#how-do-i-submit-an-mcp)의 자동 처리를 돕습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "triagebot": "triagebot"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:39.448619Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Usage",
      "source_hash": 8769925957682373409,
      "context_hash": 2315067905609348281,
      "translation": "사용법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:51.275625Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The process starts when the appropriate label is set on an issue.",
      "source_hash": 8328516458489631070,
      "context_hash": 1498962724492448740,
      "translation": "이 프로세스는 이슈에 적절한 레이블이 설정되면 시작됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈",
        "label": "레이블"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:39.448620Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "For example, the [rust-lang/compiler-team] repo has a [major change template] which will automatically set the `major-change` label.",
      "source_hash": 9799082637787010729,
      "context_hash": 15481452189846905178,
      "translation": "예를 들어, [rust-lang/compiler-team] 저장소에는 `major-change` 레이블을 자동으로 설정하는 [major change template]이 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "label": "레이블",
        "Rust": "Rust"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:39.448620Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Triagebot will detect this and create a new Zulip topic for hosting discussion, and post a comment to the issue with a link to Zulip stream.",
      "source_hash": 10056619632930741106,
      "context_hash": 3436283562393826127,
      "translation": "Triagebot는 이를 감지하여 논의를 진행할 새로운 Zulip 토픽을 생성하고, Zulip 스트림 링크가 포함된 댓글을 이슈에 남깁니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "triagebot": "triagebot",
        "Zulip": "Zulip",
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:39.448621Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "If a team member writes a comment on the GitHub issue with `@rustbot second` (or `@rustbot seconded`), then triagebot will set the appropriate label, and post a comment to Zulip.",
      "source_hash": 17335512742615705215,
      "context_hash": 8910289746285919567,
      "translation": "팀 구성원이 GitHub 이슈에 `@rustbot second`(또는 `@rustbot seconded`)라는 댓글을 작성하면, triagebot는 적절한 레이블을 설정하고 Zulip에 댓글을 남깁니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Zulip": "Zulip",
        "team member": "팀 구성원",
        "issue": "이슈",
        "label": "레이블",
        "triagebot": "triagebot"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:39.448621Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "If a team member adds the `major-change-accepted` label, then triagebot will post a comment to Zulip to let people know that it has been accepted.",
      "source_hash": 15389976345518632232,
      "context_hash": 337513501028052849,
      "translation": "팀 구성원이 `major-change-accepted` 레이블을 추가하면, triagebot는 해당 제안이 수락되었음을 알리는 댓글을 Zulip에 남깁니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "label": "레이블",
        "team member": "팀 구성원",
        "triagebot": "triagebot",
        "Zulip": "Zulip"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:39.448622Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Configuration",
      "source_hash": 4935613502183038470,
      "context_hash": 17111815635199227655,
      "translation": "설정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:51.275626Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This feature is enabled by the `[major-change]` table in `triagebot.toml`:",
      "source_hash": 14605393761865187489,
      "context_hash": 5476116926316283150,
      "translation": "이 기능은 `triagebot.toml`의 `[major-change]` 테이블을 통해 활성화됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:51.275626Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Implementation",
      "source_hash": 14188291987651099077,
      "context_hash": 7889852831279772689,
      "translation": "구현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:51.275626Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "See [`src/handlers/major_change.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/major_change.rs).",
      "source_hash": 8887592196303776585,
      "context_hash": 5801226501789644448,
      "translation": "[`src/handlers/major_change.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/major_change.rs)를 참조하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:51.275626Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}